==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|нѣ́что||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*něčьto}}. Morphologically from {{affix|ru|не-|что}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|не́что}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-нечто.ogg}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|ru|pronoun|g=n|head=не́что|indeclinable, invariable}}

# [[something]]
#: {{syn|ru|что́-то|ко́е-что́}}
#: {{ant|ru|ничто}}

====Usage notes====
* Only used in [[nominative]] and [[accusative]] cases, with no oblique declensions.
* The fact that the letter {{m|ru|ч}} represents the sound /t͡ɕ/ here, rather than /ʂ/, distinguishes this word from other compounds based on {{m|ru|что}}, such as {{m|ru|ничто́}}, {{m|ru|что́-то}}, or {{m|ru|ко́е-что́}}.
* The term is indeclinable. The inflected forms {{m|ru|не́чего}}, {{m|ru|не́чему}}, {{m|ru|не́чем}} are related but have a different meaning.

===See also===
* {{l|ru|не́чего}}, {{l|ru|не́чему}}, {{l|ru|не́чем}}
* {{l|ru|не́кто}}
